## Article 9. Prohibition of persecution of citizens for submitting appeals
##   and inadmissibility of forcing them to submit appeals

```catala
declaration scope Article9ProhibitionOfPersecution:
  input author content AppealAuthor
  input appealType content AppealType
  input containsCriticism content YesNo
  input persecutionOccurred content YesNo
  input forcedToSubmit content YesNo
  input forcedToSign content YesNo
  input forcedToParticipate content YesNo
  output persecutionProhibited content YesNo
  output forcedSubmissionProhibited content YesNo
  output forcedSigningProhibited content YesNo
  output forcedParticipationProhibited content YesNo
  output violationOccurred content YesNo

scope Article9ProhibitionOfPersecution:
  label persecution_prohibited
  definition persecutionProhibited equals Yes

  label forced_submission_prohibited
  definition forcedSubmissionProhibited equals Yes

  label forced_signing_prohibited
  definition forcedSigningProhibited equals Yes

  label forced_participation_prohibited
  definition forcedParticipationProhibited equals Yes

  label violation_occurred_exception default_no_violation
  definition violationOccurred under condition
    persecutionOccurred = Yes
    or forcedToSubmit = Yes
    or forcedToSign = Yes
    or forcedToParticipate = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_no_violation
  definition violationOccurred equals No
```
